<title>LUXEMBOURG: Cargolux says Aug traffic up 9pct, Jan-Aug up 4pct.</title>
<headline>Cargolux says Aug traffic up 9pct, Jan-Aug up 4pct.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargolux Airlines International said it flew 169.0 million freight tonne kilometres, FTK, in August 1996, up nine percent in the same month last year.</p>
<p>In the first eight months of 1996, the Luxembourg-based cargo airline flew a total of 1.28 billion FTK, an increase of four percent on 1995 levels, Cargolux said.</p>
<p>Cargolux operates a fleet of Boeing 747-400F and Boeing 747-200F aircraft. --Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 8982 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
